    text: "Affected stops:\r\nBroadway & Walnut St (#24252) (eastbound)\r\nBroadway & Spruce St (#12591) (eastbound)\r\nBroadway & Mapleton Ave (#12559) (eastbound)\r\nBroadway & Portland Pl (#12580) (eastbound)\r\nBroadway & North St (#22998) (eastbound)\r\nBroadway & North St (#23066) (westbound)\r\nBroadway & Portland Pl (#12579) (westbound)\r\nBroadway & Maxwell Ave (#12562) (westbound)\r\nBroadway & Spruce St (#12590) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 208 get on/off buses at:\r\nDowntown Boulder Station Gate P (#35520)\r\nBroadway & Alpine Ave (#12465)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 208 get on/off buses at:\r\nBroadway & Alpine Ave (#12475)\r\nDowntown Boulder Station Gate P (#35520)"
